{"data":[{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114713610379555073"],"id":"2114713610379555073","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":222,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"归根到底，就是集采光压价格，医保局从来不考虑质量。\n\n如果先把药物的一致性评价彻底落实，出现事故直接重罚，医疗器械质量问题重罚，再去落实集采，整体市场会好很多。\n\n压低价绝对不是集采的错，集采的首要任务就是极限压低价，关键是要重罚威慑药厂和器械厂落实，保证质量，才能达到性价比的平衡。 https://t.co/JduNgL0qMi","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2114713610379555073"},{"author_id":"3319804777","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:35:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114712451136799152"],"id":"2114712451136799152","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":145,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"涨知识！原来“田”里还有这么多叫法！ https://t.co/rnRRYIVBXp","url":"https://x.com/XinhuaChinese/status/2114712451136799152"},{"author_id":"1954166149","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:33:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114712112861978983"],"id":"2114712112861978983","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":846,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"币圈最好翻身的时间是过去8年\n\n2017到2025年\n这期间大饼姨太几十倍的空间\n\n二级也有普涨行情，都有巨大空间差\n铭文、NFT、MEME撸毛就更不用说了\n\n现在，闭眼睛赚钱的时代已经结束了\n2026年起，欲望肯定要降低\n\n不要指着一次一个币翻身\n做好5年到10年的长线计划\n\n每年一波行情2到3倍，还是有希望的。 https://t.co/3R1k4f8KGr","url":"https://x.com/monkeyjiang/status/2114712112861978983"},{"author_id":"28940967","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:33:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114711973388530041"],"id":"2114711973388530041","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1476,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"星巴克：太棒了，目的终于达到了！ https://t.co/Ify5fdRpvl","url":"https://x.com/lidangzzz/status/2114711973388530041"},{"author_id":"1456122926432862223","created_at":"2026-10-26T13:30:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114711325611835658"],"id":"2114711325